<hr><br>
<center>

In the <a style="text-decoration:none; color: silver" href="https://play.pokemonshowdown.com/gamecorner">PS! Game Corner</a> chat room, users can unlock the achievement Luck of the Draw by playing a shiny Pokemon in five specific card games. As at the time of writing, nearly 1000 users have unlocked it.
 
 
<br><br>The goal of the shiny Pokedex is to collect every shiny Pokemon in card games as a community.
 
 


